<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:12.000
Cat-san...?

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:18.180
It's not your fault.

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:21.780
I'm sorry, Mana...

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:31.460
No!

00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:32.400
CHAPTER 48

00:02:33.020 --> 00:02:37.460
THE VOID OF DESPAIR AND DARKNESS

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:49.350
Mom? Mom!

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:51.900
Hold on! Try to hold on!

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:53.460
Mom!

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:57.780
M... Mana...

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:00.280
Mom!

00:03:39.590 --> 00:03:41.990
This must be some mistake!

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:45.290
It has to be that "CG" stuff
the humans make!

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:50.000
Hold on. Why does Mana-chan
have such power?

00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:52.460
I'll ask.

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:55.170
Wally...

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:57.630
-Then I'll go, too!
-Me too!

00:03:57.630 --> 00:03:59.110
Stay back!

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:03.410
Sorry.

00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:06.180
I think...

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:09.950
it's better if I go alone.

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:24.410
<i>I'm currently in front of the hospital
where Junko Inuyama-san was admitted.</i>

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:27.720
MYSTERIOUS SUPER POWER?
ONE GIRL'S ACTIONS

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:27.830
<i>A video of Junko-san's daughter, Mana-san,</i>

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:31.370
<i>annihilating a </i>yokai
<i>has been uploaded to the internet.</i>

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:34.000
<i>She's currently the focus of
much attention.</i>

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:38.340
<i>There are arguments ongoing,
with some speculating it might be CG.</i>

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:44.070
<i>Does Mana Inuyama-san
truly possess such power?</i>

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:52.640
What happened, Mana?

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:55.110
I don't understand what's going on!

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:57.170
I don't know!

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:02.300
Tell me, Dad...

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:05.050
Why can I...?

00:05:06.550 --> 00:05:10.780
Mana Inuyama-san!
Why were you able to annihilate a <i>yokai</i>?!

00:05:10.780 --> 00:05:13.160
Is that video even real?!

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.960
Only family members allowed!

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:18.420
What about freedom of the press?!
Let go! Let go!

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:21.690
Does it really have to do with
Junko-san's bloodline?!

00:05:22.110 --> 00:05:23.170
Please leave!

00:05:26.360 --> 00:05:30.280
What did they mean about Mom's bloodline?

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:33.660
Tell me, Dad.

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:40.560
Your name, "Mana"...

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:44.070
was given by your mom's grandmother.

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:49.240
Your great-grandmother was
a professional worshipper.

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:50.620
A worshipper?

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:57.160
It's a person who performs exorcisms
or banishes evil spirits when asked to.

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:04.030
I only met her once when we went to
announce our engagement.

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:08.320
At the time she could barely move.

00:06:09.070 --> 00:06:13.180
But, when you were born,
she suddenly called.

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:15.350
She said to name you "Mana."

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:16.540
Then...

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:19.060
my name is...

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:23.320
When written in kanji, Mana-chan's name...

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:26.900
MANA

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:30.720
It must mean "True Name."

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:33.410
I've had my suspicions.

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:37.880
Why that child developed
a connection with us.

00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:43.190
Perhaps one of her ancestors
had a connection with a <i>yokai</i>.

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:45.670
Dad, I'm sorry.

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:51.660
All I can think about is
hearing the truth from Mana.

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:02.190
Show yourself, <i>yokai</i>!

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:06.880
I said show yourself, dammit!

00:07:07.670 --> 00:07:11.840
TOFU-KOZO

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:12.570
It says Tofu-Kozo. What a stupid name!

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:16.640
Hey now!

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:23.500
Where are you trying to go,
Tofu-Kozo-chan?

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:27.260
I-I'm just a <i>yokai</i> who has tofu!

00:07:27.260 --> 00:07:29.740
What about it?

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:33.510
Just looking at you pisses me off!

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:36.510
What did I ever do to you?!

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:40.020
Just being a <i>yokai</i> means you're a pest!

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:40.930
Stop it!

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:44.940
Don't touch Tofu-Kozo.

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:46.940
Oh! Kitaro!

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:47.860
Kitaro?

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:50.740
Oh! I've seen this guy on the internet.

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:53.450
You're an ally of humans, right?

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:55.910
Then just sit back and watch!

00:07:55.910 --> 00:08:00.000
At the very least, I'm no ally of yours.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.130
What?!

00:08:01.130 --> 00:08:02.210
Don't get cocky!

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:04.100
You little squirt!

00:08:05.230 --> 00:08:06.340
Get lost...

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:09.280
Right now...

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:11.570
Get lost!

00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:16.030
Oh crap! Run!

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:20.450
Thanks, Kitaro!

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:24.060
What are you doing here?

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:28.650
Everyone said
they're going to get the humans.

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:29.610
Everyone?

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:32.050
It's because you're too soft.

00:08:34.010 --> 00:08:35.340
Hata-Onryo.

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:39.560
HATA-ONRYO

00:08:39.970 --> 00:08:42.160
A <i>yokai</i> hunt has begun.

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:44.590
Get the <i>yokai</i>!

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:45.920
Out of the way!

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:47.000
What an eyesore!

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:48.420
How disgusting!

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:49.820
I'll get you!

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:57.320
We should fight the humans, too!

00:08:58.660 --> 00:09:00.700
We're fighting, too!

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:04.460
Let's show them our power!

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:09.270
Especially that Mana girl's power.

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:11.900
You saw it, right?

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:14.990
Catchick was completely annihilated.

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:16.590
Even her soul!

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:20.120
We can't just leave that Mana girl alone!

00:09:20.350 --> 00:09:21.710
That's right!

00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:22.870
Get her!

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:24.890
Wait, everyone!

00:09:25.190 --> 00:09:27.800
We want to find out the truth.

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:30.130
Just what is going on.

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:33.840
To clash with the humans
without knowing the truth...

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:35.990
Don't do something so foolish!

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:39.010
What if it's a misunderstanding?

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:40.850
If you mistakenly fight,

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:45.770
no matter what happens,
humans will never be able to forgive us.

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:49.520
Likewise, we won't be
able to forgive them.

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:51.800
Are you all right with that?

00:09:59.890 --> 00:10:01.240
Very well.

00:10:02.510 --> 00:10:03.990
Listen, everyone.

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:07.440
Let's all back off for Daddy Eyeball here.

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:10.750
If you say so, Hata-Onryo.

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:12.320
I guess so.

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:15.760
But hurry!

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:21.260
Our patience and the humans' patience
is near the breaking point!

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:47.520
Catchick...

00:10:56.900 --> 00:10:58.760
Mom!

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:01.260
I'm sorry. Family members outside please!

00:11:03.950 --> 00:11:07.540
No. She hasn't
regained consciousness yet.

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:10.580
Please get here as soon as you can!

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:13.980
Give me three units of blood!

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:16.000
Oxygen saturation dropping!

00:11:23.890 --> 00:11:25.120
Mom...

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:30.460
Mom!

00:11:31.770 --> 00:11:33.520
Mom!

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:36.590
Mom!

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:37.590
Mana.

00:11:45.280 --> 00:11:47.930
K... Kitaro...

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:49.560
Mana...

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:52.310
Just what happened?

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:56.840
Cat-san...

00:11:57.380 --> 00:12:00.150
Why did she hurt my mom?

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:05.620
Why?!

00:12:07.390 --> 00:12:09.620
SHIMOISHIWARA
HACHIMAN SHRINE

00:12:10.640 --> 00:12:14.120
HITOTSUME-KOZO

00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:19.340
<i>Hey, everyone!</i>

00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:19.780
OMEGA-KUN

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:22.880
<i>Today I've got</i>
<i>important news about the </i>yokai<i>.</i>

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:24.390
Important news?

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:29.390
<i>The </i>yokai<i> are trying to</i>
<i>bring disaster to Japan.</i>

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:30.890
Seriously?!

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:34.750
Wh-What is this thing saying?!

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:37.650
<i>And that disaster is...</i>

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:43.400
<i>the Hyakki-Yagyo!</i>

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:45.760
Why...

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:48.390
Why did Cat-san...

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:51.160
hurt my mom?

00:12:52.390 --> 00:12:54.020
Why did you...

00:12:54.650 --> 00:12:57.040
annihilate Catchick?

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:02.050
<i>Did you know? The Hyakki-Yagyo is</i>

00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:08.180
<i>when hordes of </i>yokai
<i>force their way into the human world.</i>

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:10.160
Mana.

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:12.790
Why did you annihilate...

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:14.500
I don't know!

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:17.690
I don't know...

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:24.590
It's just...

00:13:24.930 --> 00:13:26.660
Power suddenly came out...

00:13:26.970 --> 00:13:31.240
Then why do you have that power,
Mana-chan?!

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:34.140
Are you sure...

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:38.060
you didn't already know
you had that power?

00:13:38.520 --> 00:13:40.860
W-Wait, Kitaro!

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:49.890
<i>Persecuted and hounded to the far corners</i>
<i>of the night, the </i>yokai<i>'s wrath is</i>

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:51.890
<i>about to blow!</i>

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:56.270
If I did I would have saved Mom
before she was hurt!

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:00.860
<i>Their anger and wrath overflows,</i>

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:05.840
<i>and is about to spill over into the world
as the Hyakki-Yagyo!</i>

00:14:06.930 --> 00:14:08.640
<i>Isn't it scary?</i>

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:13.310
If you knew of your power...

00:14:14.270 --> 00:14:18.710
you said you'd use it
before your mother was hurt.

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:21.190
In that case...

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:22.860
would you...

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:27.840
have annihilated Catchick without a word?

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:31.390
Is there a point to asking that?

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:34.120
Tell me.

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:42.920
Why Cat-san would do
something like that...

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:45.150
I would have asked.

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:46.470
I see.

00:14:50.510 --> 00:14:51.450
Get back!

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:52.490
No pulse!

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:54.060
Charge to 250!

00:14:54.520 --> 00:14:55.460
Clear!

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:57.670
Mom... Mom...!

00:14:57.670 --> 00:14:58.890
Still nothing!

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:02.310
Mom!

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:06.210
<i>So where's the Hyakki-Yagyo
going to happen?</i>

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:11.240
<i>It's supposed to be a secret,
but I'll share it with just you.</i>

00:15:11.570 --> 00:15:14.720
<i>Listen up...</i>

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:18.250
<i>The Hyakki-Yagyo's
going to start in Chofu!</i>

00:15:19.620 --> 00:15:20.850
In Chofu?!

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.600
The <i>yokai</i> are invading!

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:24.780
Are we going to get eaten?

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:25.980
I'm scared!

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:28.910
Then let's get them first!

00:15:28.910 --> 00:15:30.120
That's right!

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:31.030
Right!

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:32.510
Let's get them!

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:36.410
-Head to Chofu!
-Defeat the <i>yokai</i>!

00:15:36.720 --> 00:15:37.930
Yeah!

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:42.060
What's this? What's happening?!

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:46.500
The humans are attacking!

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:48.300
I've had enough!

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:50.760
Everyone calm down!

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:54.390
Kitaro hasn't come back yet! Please wait!

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:57.680
The humans will get us before then!

00:15:57.680 --> 00:15:59.750
That's right!

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:03.900
S-Stop it!

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:08.320
It's no good.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:09.530
But...

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:12.030
It's too bad.

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:14.430
The time is 11:50 PM.

00:16:17.310 --> 00:16:18.790
She's gone.

00:16:22.980 --> 00:16:26.020
Mom...

00:16:32.610 --> 00:16:33.990
Mom...

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:35.870
You killed her.

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:38.240
I won't forgive you.

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:42.810
Get the <i>yokai</i>!

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:44.790
Kill them! Kill them!

00:16:47.460 --> 00:16:48.490
Get them!

00:16:48.490 --> 00:16:51.220
You annihilated Catchick.

00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:53.700
No, Kitaro!

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:56.180
I can't forgive you.

00:17:18.580 --> 00:17:20.510
Huh? What is that?!

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:28.750
What is this warped presence?!

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:33.610
<i>Empty, empty, empty
The empty vessel</i>

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:36.780
<i>The embodiment of reality</i>

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:41.910
<i>Hate mixed together with hate</i>

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:46.520
<i>Now let the vessel be filled at last</i>

00:17:51.110 --> 00:17:52.250
Is it Nanashi?!

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:10.590
WATER

00:18:13.420 --> 00:18:18.740
<i>Gathered, gathered</i>

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:22.250
<i>The gathered five elements</i>

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:27.140
<i>The pentagram is born</i>

00:18:22.310 --> 00:18:27.140
WOOD / FIRE / EARTH / METAL / WATER

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:32.000
<i>Become the upside down pentagram</i>

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:37.570
<i>Time for the reversal of the elements</i>

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:42.510
You fool!

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:46.270
Just look at what you've done!

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:49.860
You shamelessly let
your hate overcome you!

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:53.240
Mana-chan's hate and your hate.

00:18:53.240 --> 00:18:56.560
The humans' hate and the <i>yokai</i>'s hate.

00:18:56.560 --> 00:18:59.130
It gave him strength!

